{"version":1,"key":"card:439","content":{"id":439,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"元组：不可修改的序列。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"2d2e64ca-6bf1-486c-8ed5-337e8cc98100","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"元组使用逗号分隔即可创建。还可以使用圆括号括起（常用做法）。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"1415607f-236f-4f26-b1d8-b71a6392157d","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":">>> 1, 2, 3\n(1, 2, 3)\n>>> (1, 2, 3)\n(1, 2, 3)","collabId":"d06f425f-2509-43da-a7ba-038d4c69cc41","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"cb80e4b4-0686-4cf7-80c9-e9cb34f6792c","language":"py","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"b06ad7b0-601d-40d5-afe0-fc8128b78425"},{"calloutType":"warning","children":[{"children":[{"text":"只包含一个值的元组，虽然只有一个值，也必须在它后面加上逗号。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e046fac7-d5b6-42af-8888-c0f93151130b","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":">>> (42,)\n(42,)","collabId":"1e116985-b804-4878-bc68-b341d2baa6f2","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"af862e9f-d022-47a4-b18a-666de589b65e","language":"py","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"617ccd71-7113-462a-8edb-147aa30d5a7a"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":">>> 3 * (40 + 2)\n126\n>>> 3 * (40 + 2,)\n(42, 42, 42)","collabId":"1cc4e023-fbda-49ff-be09-a4103b44a74e","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"48db9fed-a263-43ed-a8b8-bcb16d1917fd","language":"py","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"90f519be-b027-4b43-92d7-292bb6618e19"}],"collabId":"0993e3bb-fe65-4c9f-bae1-5f8b31b13f0b","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","title":"注意","type":"callout"},{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"tuple","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 可以将一个序列转化为元组","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e99f2358-7bd3-4af8-9ba6-1624e37e7b9c","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":">>> tuple([1, 2, 3])\n(1, 2, 3)\n>>> tuple('abc')\n('a', 'b', 'c')\n>>> tuple((1, 2, 3))\n(1, 2, 3)","collabId":"3f88b075-3af1-4c06-b050-994d4a6b4d0a","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"54ceefa6-22b6-4867-ac78-e666c304cc8b","language":"py","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"11e4a4b0-1dd9-4552-9ee0-49c548a995ca"}],"tags":["Python/序列/元组"],"createTime":1719044062485,"updateTime":1793532525118,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532525118}}